      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s02-p08/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s02-p08/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH02_S05:L": "V_CH02_S05_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p01",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"I'd like to. But I have friends to find, and so much to understand.\" \"You only understand what you take time to know. People buy things others have already made.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p01/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p01/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p01/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p01/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p01/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p02",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"But no shop sells friendship. That's why people have so few friends. If you want a friend, tame me.\" \"What must I do?\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p02/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p02/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p02/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p02/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p02/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p03",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Don't hurry. Sit a little way from me, in the grass. I'll watch you. Don't speak. Words don't always help us understand each other. Every day, sit a little closer.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p03/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p03/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p03/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p03/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p03/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p04",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "The next day, the little prince came back. \"It would be better to come at the same time each day.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p04/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p04/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p04/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p04/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p04/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p05",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S03:L",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"If you come at four, I'll begin to feel happy at three. I'll grow happier as the time gets closer. By four, I'll be jumping about, excited and a little nervous.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p05/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p05/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p05/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p05/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p05/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S03:L": "V_CH21_S03_L",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p06",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:R"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"But if you come whenever you like, how will my heart know when to be ready? We need special habits.\" \"Special habits?\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p06/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p06/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p06/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p06/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p06/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH21_S02:R": "V_CH21_S02_R"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p07",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:R"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Things that make one day different from another. My hunters dance with the village girls on Thursdays. So Thursday is my day to walk among the grape plants.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p07/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p07/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p07/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p07/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p07/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH21_S02:R": "V_CH21_S02_R"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s03-p08",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:R"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"If they danced on any day they liked, every day would be the same for me. I'd never have a holiday.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p08/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p08/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p08/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p08/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s03-p08/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH21_S02:R": "V_CH21_S02_R"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s04-p01",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "So the little prince tamed the fox. But the day came when he had to leave. \"I'm going to cry.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p01/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p01/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p01/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p01/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p01/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R": "V_CH21_S03_R",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s04-p02",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"But you asked me to tame you. I never wanted to hurt you.\" \"Yes.\" \"And now you'll cry?\" \"Yes.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p02/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p02/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p02/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p02/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p02/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R": "V_CH21_S03_R",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s04-p03",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Then it hasn't helped you at all.\" \"It has. Because of the color of the wheat.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p03/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p03/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p03/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p03/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p03/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S03:R": "V_CH21_S03_R",
        "CH21_S02:L": "V_CH21_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s04-p04",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH03_S03:R"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Go back to the roses. You'll understand why yours is different from all the others. Then come and say goodbye. I'll give you a secret.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p04/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p04/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p04/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p04/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s04-p04/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH21_B01:ONE": "A_CH21_B01_ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R": "V_CH21_S01_R",
        "CH03_S03:R": "V_CH03_S03_R"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s05-p01",
      "assets": [
        "CH20_B01:ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"You aren't like my rose. Nobody has tamed you, and you haven't tamed anyone. My fox was once like any other fox. Now he's my friend. There is no other like him.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p01/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p01/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p01/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p01/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p01/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH20_B01:ONE": "A_CH20_B01_ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s05-p02",
      "assets": [
        "CH20_B01:ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "The roses said nothing. They seemed to wish he would stop. \"You're beautiful, but empty. No one could die for you.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p02/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p02/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p02/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p02/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p02/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH20_B01:ONE": "A_CH20_B01_ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s05-p03",
      "assets": [
        "CH20_B01:ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Someone passing by might think my rose looks just like you. But she is more important to me than all of you together.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p03/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p03/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p03/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p03/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p03/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH20_B01:ONE": "A_CH20_B01_ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s05-p04",
      "assets": [
        "CH20_B01:ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"She's the one I watered. The one I covered with glass and kept out of the wind. For her, I killed the caterpillars, except two or three to become butterflies.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p04/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p04/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p04/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p04/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p04/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH20_B01:ONE": "A_CH20_B01_ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s05-p05",
      "assets": [
        "CH20_B01:ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"I listened when she complained, when she spoke proudly, and even when she said nothing. Because she is my rose.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p05/ASSEMBLY.md",
      "layout": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p05/layout.json",
      "placement_guide": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p05/PLACEMENT_GUIDE.png",
      "max_generation_rounds": 3,
      "geometry_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p05/layout.json",
      "text_alignment_contract": "story-and-continuity/chapter-21/page-compositions/c21-s05-p05/layout.json",
      "reference_lineage": {
        "CH20_B01:ONE": "A_CH20_B01_ONE",
        "CH02_S02:L": "V_CH02_S02_L"
      }
    },
    {
      "page": "c21-s06-p01",
      "assets": [
        "CH21_B01:ONE",
        "CH21_S01:R",
        "CH21_S02:L"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"Goodbye.\" \"Goodbye. Here is my secret. It's simple: you must look with your heart. The most important things are invisible to your eyes.\"",
